{"id":"P082-2","subject":"P","unit":"P082","unitTitle":"2025 ② (5월~8월) · 25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P082-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 2차측 무부하 단자전압이\n                 V일 때, 1차측에 흐르는 전류cos\n은 몇 A인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① sin       ②                                  sin\n③              ④             cos          cos","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e04-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":1022},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m26-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P082-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n다음과 같은 평형 3상 부하의 상전압이 22kV이다.\n\n부하에 전원이 공급되던 중에 선의 중간 ×지점에서 단선\n\n이 발생한 경우, ×지점 양단의 전압은 몇 kV인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 33          ② 36\n\n③ 40          ④ 44","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e04-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m27-q.webp","width":696,"height":1020},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m27-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m27-e3.webp","width":678,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P082-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n다음 그림에서 저항은 Ω이고 전류계의 각 지시값\n이 A, A, A 일 때, 부하의 소비\n\n전력은 약 몇 W인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 120         ② 130\n\n③ 140         ④ 150","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e04-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m28-q.webp","width":678,"height":897},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m28-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P082-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n아래의 그림에서 mH , mF이며, 여기에\nsinV를 인가할 때 전류 A 가 흐르고,\nsinV를 인가할 때 전류 A 가 흐르고,\nsinV를 인가할 때 전류 A 가 흐른다.\n이 때, 라면, 저항 은 몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 2           ② 4\n\n③ 6           ④ 8","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e04-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m29-q.webp","width":678,"height":985},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m29-e1.webp","width":678,"height":836}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P082-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n함수 의 변환은?\n\n\n                     \n①            ②  \n      \n③            ④","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e04-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m30-q.webp","width":696,"height":568},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m30-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1046}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P082-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n다음 미분방정식에서 가 입력, 가 출력일 때,\n\n전달함수는? (단, 모든 초깃값은 0이다.)\n\n                                                  \n\n\n\n                             \n①            ②    \n\n                                  \n③            ④ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e04-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m31-q.webp","width":696,"height":702},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m31-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P082-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 Ω일 때, 단자 와 를\n기준으로 우측을 합성한 저항 는 약 몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 24          ② 27\n\n③ 30          ④ 33","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e04-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m32-q.webp","width":696,"height":573},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m32-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m32-e2.webp","width":696,"height":412}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P082-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n다음과 같은 그림에서 V, Ω이고, 최대\n\n저항이 100Ω인 가변저항을 이용해서 전류를 양쪽으로\n\n나누어 흘리고 있다. 에 흐르는 전류가 최소가 되기 위\n한 가변저항의 아랫부분에 대한 저항 는 몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 30          ② 40\n\n③ 50          ④ 60","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e04-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m33-q.webp","width":678,"height":824},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e04-m33-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1472}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P082-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.05.17 부산교통공사(전기) (사람인) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n두 개의 전선을 병렬로 접속하는 경우, 알루미늄선의 최소\n단면적은 몇 mm이상으로 해야 하는가?\n\n\n① 50          ② 60\n\n③ 70          ④ 8